  "name": "[EN556 gravity filtered polysaccharide/glucosidase hydrolysis rates] - Hydrolysis rates from gravity filtered samples, plate reader results from RV/Endeavor EN556, 2015 (Patterns of activities project) (Latitudinal and depth-related contrasts in enzymatic capabilities of pelagic microbial communities: Predictable patterns in the ocean?)",
